+| `electronics` Machinery & electronics | 84, 85, 90 |
+| `vehicles` Vehicles, aircraft & ships | 86-89 |
+| `arms` Arms & ammunition | 93 |
+| `manufactures` Other manufactures | 68-70, 91-92, 94-97, 99 |
